  "details": "First request: Ability to see the creation date of a world instance\n\nSecond request: Ability to see the date a world was added to favorites\n\nThe reason I think the first request is good is that you can know in advance when the instance will reset and you can see when the instance was running.\n\nThe reason I think the second request is good is that you can see the date a world was added to favorites. This will help you remember memorable places and when you visited and favorited them, and reminisce on old memories!",
